  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The ability to manifest by committing sins, commonly known as Sin.\n\nAmidst the rampant heinous crimes caused by Sin, Ren Hizuki, a detective in the First Investigative Division of the Metropolitan Police Department, was living a life of fierce battles day and night.\n\nOne day, Ren is ordered to transfer to the newly established special ability crime investigation unit, Public Safety Section 9. There, she meets a cowardly detective named Yujiro Oboro. \n\nAs she heads to investigate ability-related cases with Oboro, the secrets of Section 9 and the true identity of Oboro begin to come to light."
  },
